SCRIPT
Chinese narration, Scripture quotations, programme title and sign-off supplied by the user. English captions authored for the earlier approved edition and retained here. Scripture references and interpretation notes: FACTS.md. No named English Bible translation is claimed.

VISUALS AND CHALK WRITING
Original classroom equation, sliding-board lesson, crowd, kings, heart, covenant line, cross, tomb, trust correction, camera and typography authored for this film. The film is symbolic art and does not claim a historical diagram or likeness.
Chinese board lettering uses complete LXGW WenKai glyphs with seeded chalk texture and a progressive reveal, replacing malformed custom stroke drawings after user feedback. The reveal does not claim authentic calligraphic stroke order. All primary board labels are Chinese; the SoulQuake brand remains in Latin lettering.
Chalkboard helpers in js/ are adapted from lemomo-ai/lemo-opuscar, styles/chalkboard/demo, MIT. The demo’s Chinese-character lesson, writing, ancient forms, board design, camera route and score were not copied. Toolkit: https://github.com/lemomo-ai/lemo-opuscar .

